# Read by systemd. Put one KEY=value assignment on each line.
# To permit additional daemon input directories, use a colon-separated list.
# INCANT_PATH_ROOTS=/srv/books:/mnt/library
# Put provider API keys here or in /var/lib/incant/.env (owner incant, mode 600), e.g. CLAUDE_API_KEY=…;
# the TOML names them with api_key_env. Keys in a TOML file are refused.
# Don't set INCANT_REVIEW_HOST here: it is for the container image and bypasses the LAN-binding check.
